WHATNOW

What tam-pane is doing now and what comes next. Read this first; revise
it at the end of every session (work/README-work).

Updated: 2026-11-19, with W8


STATE

  Version 0.0.3 on branch dev, pushed. Fred accepted 0.0.3, interactive
  tags, on 2026-11-17 (W6): view a tag, toggle tags in the view, move a
  window to a tag, add or remove tags on a window (never the last one),
  previous view, and focus remembered per view.

  Follows the tam-idol 0.2.0 standard (W8, 2026-11-19). That change
  touched READMEs and records only; no code changed, so VERSION stays
  0.0.3.

  Dynamic tiling (dwindle), floating and fullscreen work; Lua, panels,
  multiple monitors and the desktop protocols do not yet. Dependencies
  today: wlroots 0.20, wayland-server, xkbcommon, libtam.

  Development runs nested in Hyprland (tools/nested-input, which passes
  host shortcuts through while the nested window has focus) and headless
  (tests/smoke-headless.sh, tests/run-input-headless.sh).


NEXT

